    "detailed_description": "\u2200kashicforce is a puzzle-game-like, rhythm-game-like game where you input commands to use moves like in a fighting game. The goal is to crush your opponent to a pulp with an immense amount of blocks. In order to put yourself in a better position, kill your opponent's blocks while they are falling down or send Hindrance blocks into their field.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique mix of different game genres<br></li><li>6 playable characters<br></li><li>Local split-screen multiplayer<br></li><li>English and Japanese language support</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Preface</h2><br><strong>[Log No.891247:817:38:00]</strong><br>We have confirmed an exponential increase in Anonymous-class Enemies in the &quot;Kestrel&quot; division. Cause unknown at the moment. The division superintendent is currently dealing with them and investigating the cause.<br><br><strong>[Log No.891247:817:38:01]</strong><br>The Kestrel division superintendent sent assistance requests to adjacent divisions. Later, additional assistance was confirmed. The situation is anticipated to be fully taken care of and subdued shortly.<br><br><strong>[Log No.891247:817:38:02]</strong><br>The Kestrel division superintendent proposed the anti-Enemy squad a plan similar to a game.<br>As one of the basic rules, the number of Enemies killed inside of the specified fields defines victory and defeat. Refer to the attached for details. Pending approval.",
